{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22098","headline":"早送举人入试 · 白居易","name":"早送举人入试","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙驾送举人，东方犹未明。\n自谓出太早，已有车马行。\n骑火高低影，街鼓参差声。\n可怜早朝者，相看意气生。\n日出尘埃飞，羣动互营营。\n营营各何求，无非利与名。\n而我常晏起，虚住长安城。\n春深官又满，日有归山情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}